  "description": "🚀 RS.Dapper.Utility – Multi-Database Made Simple\n\nManaging multiple databases in C# with Dapper just got easier!\nWith RS.Dapper.Utility, you can now connect to SQL Server, MySQL, and PostgreSQL effortlessly — whether you’re working with one database or several.\n\n✨ Why RS.Dapper.Utility?\n\n🔹 Multi-Database Support – Configure and switch between multiple databases directly from appsettings.json.\n\n🔹 DatabaseResolver Built-In – Connections are now managed by DatabaseResolver, removing the need for DapperContext.\n\n🔹 Simplified CRUD Operations – Dynamic SQL generation for Insert, Update, Delete, and Select.\n\n🔹 Secure by Default – Always uses parameterized queries to prevent SQL injection.\n\n🔹 Lightweight Integration – Works seamlessly with your existing Dapper-based projects.",
